   "fix": "Add a lemma such as `Measure.mem_support_iff_measure_singleton_ne_zero [DiscreteTopology X] [MeasurableSingletonClass X]` to TauCeti/MeasureTheory/Measure/Support.lean, which this file already imports. Then reduce the native proof to `rw [that lemma, hypergeometricMeasure_singleton_ne_zero_iff h.1 h.2]; simp only [mem_Icc, le_min_iff]; omega`.",
